# Unit04
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2024红宝书考研英语词汇
# 描述: 必考词Unit04核心词汇

conform/kənˈfɔːrm/遵守；符合/All products must conform to safety standards.
confront/kənˈfrʌnt/面对/He confronted his fears bravely.
confuse/kənˈfjuːz/使困惑/The instructions confused the students.
congress/ˈkɑːŋɡrəs/国会/Congress passed the new tax bill.
conscience/ˈkɑːnʃəns/良心/His conscience would not allow him to lie.
conscious/ˈkɑːnʃəs/有意识的/She was conscious of her own limitations.
consensus/kənˈsensəs/共识/The committee reached a consensus on the issue.
consent/kənˈsent/同意/You need parental consent for this activity.
consequence/ˈkɑːnsɪkwens/后果/He suffered the consequences of his actions.
conservative/kənˈsɜːrvətɪv/保守的/He holds conservative political views.
considerable/kənˈsɪdərəbl/相当大的/She has considerable experience in this field.
consist/kənˈsɪst/由…组成/The committee consists of twelve members.
consistent/kənˈsɪstənt/一致的/Her work has been consistently excellent.
constant/ˈkɑːnstənt/持续的/The machine operates at a constant speed.
constitute/ˈkɑːnstɪtuːt/构成/Women constitute 60% of the workforce.
construct/kənˈstrʌkt/建造/They plan to construct a new highway.
consult/kənˈsʌlt/咨询/You should consult a doctor about your symptoms.
consume/kənˈsuːm/消耗/The car consumes too much gasoline.
consumption/kənˈsʌmpʃn/消费/Consumer consumption has increased this year.
contact/ˈkɑːntækt/接触/Please contact me if you have any questions.
contain/kənˈteɪn/包含/The report contains important data.
contaminate/kənˈtæmɪneɪt/污染/The river was contaminated by factory waste.
contemplate/ˈkɑːntəmpleɪt/沉思/She contemplated the meaning of life.
contemporary/kənˈtempəreri/当代的/She is a contemporary artist.
contend/kənˈtend/竞争；主张/He contended that the decision was unfair.
context/ˈkɑːntekst/上下文/You need to understand the context of the statement.
contradict/ˌkɑːntrəˈdɪkt/反驳；矛盾/The evidence contradicts his testimony.
contrary/ˈkɑːntreri/相反的/On the contrary, I think it's a good idea.
contrast/ˈkɑːntræst/对比/The contrast between the two paintings is striking.
contribute/kənˈtrɪbjuːt/贡献/She contributed significantly to the research.
controversial/ˌkɑːntrəˈvɜːrʃl/有争议的/The topic is highly controversial.
convention/kənˈvenʃn/惯例；大会/It is a convention to shake hands when meeting.
conventional/kənˈvenʃənl/传统的/She has a conventional approach to teaching.
convince/kənˈvɪns/说服/She convinced the jury of her innocence.
cooperate/koʊˈɑːpəreɪt/合作/The two companies agreed to cooperate on the project.
coordinate/koʊˈɔːrdɪneɪt/协调/We need to coordinate our efforts.
cope/koʊp/应对/She learned to cope with stress effectively.
core/kɔːr/核心/Hard work is the core of success.
corporate/ˈkɔːrpərət/公司的/The company has a strong corporate culture.
correspond/ˌkɔːrəˈspɑːnd/通信；对应/The results correspond with our predictions.
corrupt/kəˈrʌpt/腐败的/The corrupt official was arrested.
counsel/ˈkaʊnsl/建议；律师/She sought legal counsel before signing the contract.
counterpart/ˈkaʊntərpɑːrt/对应的人/He met with his counterpart from the other company.
couple/ˈkʌpl/一对；夫妇/The couple celebrated their anniversary.
crack/kræk/裂缝/There is a crack in the wall.
craft/kræft/工艺；手艺/She learned the craft of pottery making.
crash/kræʃ/碰撞/The stock market crashed in 2008.
create/kriˈeɪt/创造/The artist created a beautiful sculpture.
creative/kriˈeɪtɪv/有创造力的/She is a very creative designer.
crisis/ˈkraɪsɪs/危机/The country is facing a severe economic crisis.
